Sval: "Use Favorite" picks from Sval's Favorites

The custom home page's bookmarks button opens Firefox's selectBookmark
dialog, which reads Places bookmarks; Sval keeps favorites in its own store
and offers them as a menu at the button (settings-favorites.js). The
button's setting decides what a press does in its onUserClick, which no
chrome API replaces.

